description "Darth Cognus

The Huntress, an agile force powered assassin. Has a duo spec for either her force powered Sith years or her earlier bounty hunting days.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- 10% Faster Swings
- Cognus' Melee Weapon (Saber, Duals/Fast Style)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (0)
-- Blaster Defense (0)
> Dual Lightsabers 
> Dual Force Pikes 
> Dual Vibro-Blades 
> Dual Knives
- Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]

^5Force Powers:
- Force Jump (2)
- Force Pull (1)
- Force Sense (1)
- Force Speed (1)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (3)
- Healing (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Force Block (1)
- Getup (3)
- Knockdown Roll
- Force Focus (1)
- Bunny Hop
- Slow Faller
- Aerial Force Regen
- Anti Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]"
